### AETHERIA — UPGRADE V8

### Advanced Companions, Mounts, Pets & Creature Bonding System

For V8, I recommend focusing on the creatures and companions that accompany the player throughout their journey.

Aetheria should feel less like a world where the player travels alone and more like a world filled with creatures that can be discovered, befriended, trained, ridden, collected, and developed.

This is strictly designed around your single-player vision.

