### 15\. Master V8 development directive

# AETHERIA — UPGRADE V8
## ADVANCED COMPANIONS, CREATURE BONDING, MOUNTS & CREATURE ECOLOGY

### PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Expand Aetheria with a comprehensive single-player companion and creature ecosystem.

Players should be able to discover, recruit, bond with, train, customize, and develop companions and creatures.

This upgrade must remain strictly SINGLE-PLAYER.

Do not introduce multiplayer, online services, guilds, matchmaking, or player-to-player trading.

### 1. PROJECT DISCOVERY

- Inspect existing character, NPC, creature, combat, animation, and inventory systems.
- Identify existing mount or companion functionality.
- Reuse existing AI and combat architecture.
- Document integration points.
- Create a staged implementation plan.

