### FINAL EXPECTATION

Deliver a cohesive single-player Aetheria V8 creature and companion expansion.

Companions must feel like meaningful characters. Creatures must behave naturally. Mounts must expand exploration without undermining existing world design.

Connect V8 to V4's world simulation, V5's combat, V6's crafting, and V7's exploration systems.

Prioritize personality, useful behavior, meaningful progression, and technical stability.

My recommendation: Make V8's defining feature the Companion Bonding System. A legendary creature should not simply be another item to collect. It should have a personality, a history, a unique way of interacting with the player, and a progression journey of its own.
